  "answer_text": "Eunice is portrayed by **Emily Perkins** in *She's the Man* (2006). Eunice is one of the greatest supporting characters in the film \u2014 the eager, awkward, braces-wearing nerd who becomes Duke's lab partner.\n\nInterestingly, Emily Perkins is actually the polar opposite of her character in real life \u2014 as director Andy Fickman noted, \"She doesn't have the braces, she doesn't have the headgear. She is a stunningly beautiful woman.\" Perkins was so good at transforming into Eunice that they actually made her role much bigger \u2014 after the first read-through, Fickman recalled, \"The first thing we said was, 'Give this girl more lines.'\"",
